OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is hospitality's 'elephant in
OL,4,Athe room'?                             
OL,6,FThe pressures of working in the        
OL,7,Fhospitality industry are being         
OL,8,Fhighlighted by a life-size inflatable  
OL,9,Felephant that is being taken to Mount  
OL,10,FEverest.                               
OL,12,FThe Burnt Chef Project (TBCP) is a     
OL,13,Fnon-profit initiative that began in    
OL,14,FBournemouth, Dorset, working to support
OL,15,Fthe mental well-being of hospitality   
OL,16,Fworkers.                               
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
