OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is hospitality's 'elephant in
OL,4,Athe room'?                             
OL,6,FIts next challenge is in April 2027,   
OL,7,Fwhen 14 volunteers will be embarking on
OL,8,Fan expedition to Everest's base camp   
OL,9,Fwith Evie, an inflatable life-size     
OL,10,Felephant designed to illustrate mental 
OL,11,Fhealth struggles in the sector.        
OL,13,FMica Martua, global sales director,    
OL,14,Fsaid: "The campaign is about much more 
OL,15,Fthan climbing a mountain. It's about   
OL,16,Fmaking sure mental health is no longer 
OL,17,Fthe elephant in the room."             
